OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in bin bag
OL,4,Aremains unidentified one week on
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the death of a
OL,7,Fwoman who was found dead in a bin bag
OL,8,Fin a Liverpool park have been unable to
OL,9,Fidentify her a week on from the
OL,10,Fdiscovery.
OL,12,FThe woman, believed to have been in her
OL,13,F70s, was found in the Stanley Park in
OL,14,FAnfield on Friday, wearing a cerise
OL,15,Fpink Nike t-shirt, described as about
OL,16,F5ft 2in (1.6m) tall, white, and with
OL,17,Fstrawberry blonde hair.
OL,19,FA Merseyside Police spokeswoman said:
OL,20,F"We have had a significant response
OL,21,Ffrom the public but would continue to
OL,22,Fask people to come forward."
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
