OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in bin bag
OL,4,Aremains unidentified one week on
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe admitted the force had yet to
OL,7,Fidentify the woman, who they believe
OL,8,Fmay have been left at the spot in a
OL,9,Fwalled garden in the park for weeks.
